\details{
Component \eqn{i} has the form
\deqn{
(1-B)^{d_i}(1-B^{m_i})^{D_i}
(1-\phi_i(B))(1-\Phi_i(B)) y_t =
c_i + \sqrt{v_{i,t}}\epsilon_t
}
and is selected independently at each time with probability \eqn{\alpha_i}.
